<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary</p>
<p>slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     10.40 /10.20   10.90 /10.70    11.50 /11.30</p>
<p> BPI		     10.40 /10.25   11.00 /10.80    11.50 /11.40</p>
<p> Citibank		10.50 /10.30   10.90 /10.70    11.50 /11.30</p>
<p> Hongkong Bank	 10.35 /10.25   10.85 /10.70    11.35 /11.25</p>
<p> Metrobank	     10.48 /10.31   10.90 /10.785  11.525/11.430</p>
<p> Solidbank	     10.40 /10.30   10.85 /10.75    11.50 /11.40</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     10.50 /10.25   10.85 /10.60    11.50 /11.25</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
